version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
repository-code: "https://github.com/perciyaldhayalan/quantum-schrodinger-solver.git"
url: "https://github.com/perciyaldhayalan/quantum-schrodinger-solver"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - quantum mechanics
  - Schrodinger equation
  - computational physics
  - numerical methods
  - quantum tunnelling
  - Crank-Nicolson
  - finite differences
  - scientific computing
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented computational physics project for solving and validating
  the one-dimensional stationary and time-dependent Schrodinger equations.
  The software implements sparse finite-difference Hamiltonians, stationary
  eigensolvers, quantum observables, analytical and semi-analytical validation,
  Crank-Nicolson wavepacket propagation, and quantitative rectangular-barrier
  tunnelling studies comparing time-dependent simulations with
  momentum-averaged stationary scattering theory.
